  <section class="mission">
    <div class="mission-img" style="background-image:url('/img/etudiants-campus-universite.jpg')" role="img" aria-label="Students talking outside their university in France"></div>
    <div class="mission-txt">
      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="slabel">Why we exist</p>
        <h2>What we wish we'd<br><span class="grad">found when we arrived.</span></h2>
        <p>Settling in France when you arrive from East Africa means one administrative step after another with no bearings: visa validation, opening a bank account, registering with social security, applying for housing benefit, job hunting. Each step conditions the next, and reliable information is hard to find.</p>
        <p>ImiziLinks exists so that this period is no longer faced alone.</p>
        <div class="mission-points">
          <div class="mp"><div class="mp-ico">🧭</div><div><h3 class="mp-t">Reliable, first-hand information</h3><p class="mp-d">Guides written by people who went through the procedures, not copies of official text.</p></div></div>
          <div class="mp"><div class="mp-ico">🤝</div><div><h3 class="mp-t">Local contacts you can reach</h3><p class="mp-d">Volunteer members in Paris, Lyon, Bordeaux, Marseille, Lille, Toulouse and Nantes.</p></div></div>
          <div class="mp"><div class="mp-ico">🌱</div><div><h3 class="mp-t">Support over time</h3><p class="mp-d">After settling in come studies, work and projects: the community stays around.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec light" id="actions-accueil">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <p class="slabel">What we do</p>
        <h2>Three concrete services<br><span class="grad">to move forward in France.</span></h2>
        <p>Each service answers a need raised by the community. Nothing abstract: help you can ask for, offers you apply to, events you sign up for.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="act-grid reveal">
        <a href="/en/support/" class="act-card act-1">
          <div class="act-ico">🤝</div>
          <h3 class="act-t">Support &amp; paperwork</h3>
          <p class="act-d">Proof of accommodation, residence permit, CAF, social security, temporary housing. You describe your need and a local contact replies within 48 hours.</p>
          <span class="act-go">Discover support →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/opportunities/" class="act-card act-2">
          <div class="act-ico">💼</div>
          <h3 class="act-t">Jobs &amp; internships</h3>
          <p class="act-d">Roles entrusted by our partner companies. You send us your CV, we pass your application straight to the recruiter.</p>
          <span class="act-go">See the offers →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/events/" class="act-card act-3">
          <div class="act-ico">🗓️</div>
          <h3 class="act-t">Events &amp; meet-ups</h3>
          <p class="act-d">Career forums, webinars on paperwork, CV workshops and community evenings in Paris, Lyon and Bordeaux. Free to attend.</p>
          <span class="act-go">See the calendar →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec">
    <div class="wrap">
